WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.004
- You get really into
dressing up though, right?

00:00:02.004 --> 00:00:02.837
- I do.

00:00:02.837 --> 00:00:03.670
- I love it as well.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.503
- Oh my God, yes.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:05.550
- What's some of your favorite costumes?

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.170
What's some of your favorite done?

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:10.308
- Well, I kinda outdid
myself when I turned 50.

00:00:10.308 --> 00:00:12.330
- Okay, wait. What? Wait, what?

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.248
- I know.

00:00:13.248 --> 00:00:14.218
- Who?

00:00:14.218 --> 00:00:16.845
- Be surprised. But no, I am 54 years old.

00:00:16.845 --> 00:00:17.906
(crowd applauds)

00:00:17.906 --> 00:00:18.930
So I am definitely a
woman of a certain age.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.580
- I'm officially just
pissed off right now.

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.788
(crowd laughs)

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:25.913
I am 39 years old and
we look the same age.

00:00:25.913 --> 00:00:27.340
What is happening?

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.960
I just need a minute for that to sink in.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.610
I'm very upset. I'm gonna drink now, go.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.860
- No, no, no, we have to finish.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.250
- What did you dress up as?

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.120
- Okay, I dressed up as...

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:40.358
- The person who found
the fountain of youth?

00:00:40.358 --> 00:00:41.720
(audience laughs)

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:46.720
- No, I actually dressed up
as 50 Cynt, like C Y N T.

00:00:47.101 --> 00:00:49.281
- [Kelly] Aww, that's awesome.

00:00:49.281 --> 00:00:50.735
- And I've always just been very, like,

00:00:50.735 --> 00:00:51.620
transparent about my age, you know.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:54.263
- I would be too if I looked like you.

